Nemo Messenger — dual licence by path
Copyright (c) 2026 Martin Mkhitaryan

This repository is not under a single licence for every path.

  • Specification, wire encodings, blind server, and deploy: MIT
    → LICENSE-MIT
  • Client core, FFI, and apps (link libsignal): AGPL-3.0-only
    → LICENSE-AGPL-3.0

Which paths use which licence, and the rules that keep them separate:
  → LICENSE.md
  → docs/decisions/0028-implementation-languages-and-libraries.md

Third-party dependencies keep their own licences:
  → NOTICE
  → THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

Do not treat this file or a hosting-site “MIT” label as applying to a
distributed Nemo client binary. That binary is AGPL-3.0-only once
libsignal is linked. Nemo’s licence does not relicense third-party code.

